UID:13497-1777125600-1777141800@durhamcentralpark.org
SUMMARY:Bull City Beer Mile
DESCRIPTION:*What is a Beer Mile?*\nA 1-mile drinking race combining running and speed drinking. The race takes place on a 1/4-mile loop around Central Park. The race begins with the consumption of a 12-oz beer (RUN DRM lager brewed by The Glass Jug Beer Lab)\, followed by a 1/4 mile lap around the park. The second lap continues similarly; another 12-oz beer is consumed before commencing the running of the second lap. This process is repeated for the next two laps. Following the completion of the fourth beer and fourth running lap\, you will cross the finish line! \nYou can compete as an individual or as part of a 2- or 4-person relay team. All competitors must be 21+. \n  \n*Party in the Park*\nThis is more than just a race…it’s a party! With heats starting from 2:30pm until 5:00pm\, and the party going until 6:30 PM\, we’ll have DJ Gummy keeping things popping. The Glass Jug mobile beer trailer will be providing refreshments in the park\, and food will be available. \nRunners and spectators are encouraged to hang out in the park to cheer on the runners and enjoy a beer of their own during the race. The after-party will continue in the park until 6:30pm with The Glass Jug remaining open until 12:00am. \nThe official race beer will be brewed and served by The Glass Jug Beer Lab. Draft and 6-packs of 12-ounce cans will be available for purchase throughout the event\, in addition to the rest of their always fantastic beer lineup! \nPlease drink and run responsibly! \nMore Info\nhttps://runsignup.com/Race/NC/Durham/BullCityBeerMile
URL:https://durhamcentralpark.org/upcoming-event/bull-city-beer-mile-2/
LOCATION:Durham Central Park\, 501 Foster Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://durhamcentralpark.org/content/uploads/beer-mile.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Glass Jug":MAILTO:sales@glass-jug.com
END:VEVENT
